
%h3 Length of Time Homeless
%p
  To prioritize housing assistance, we look at the total number of nights someone has experienced homelessness.
%p
  If you are adding more than 1.5 years (548 nights) of non-HMIS nights to an individual's assessment you will need to complete the
  %a{ href: 'https://bit.ly/pathways24addnights', target: :blank } Documenting Boston Homeless Nights form (bit.ly/pathways24addnights)
  and send it to the CE Team at ceteam@homestart.org.
%p
  %strong Note:
  Boston families may be displaced when they receive a shelter placement outside of Boston through the State’s Emergency Assistance program.  Please include all time sheltered outside of Boston when the family became homeless in Boston.
